OL,3,GNEWSAPickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Awith careless driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngland goalkeeper Jordan Pickford
OL,7,Fnearly caused a crash with two other
OL,8,Fcars during a bout of careless driving
OL,9,Fin his #200,000 Lamborghini supercar, a
OL,10,Fcourt has heard.
OL,12,FThe 32-year-old was pulled over by
OL,13,Fpolice after ignoring a give way sign,
OL,14,Fforcing two cars to slam on the brakes,
OL,15,Fand then speeding off into the
OL,16,Fdistance.
OL,18,FThe incident happened in the Cheshire
OL,19,Ftown of Knutsford on 14 April, sparking
OL,20,Fa criminal prosecution for driving
OL,21,Fwithout due care or attention.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
