OL,3,GNEWSAPickford 'almost caused crash'
OL,4,Awith careless driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FPickford, who has 336 appearances for
OL,7,FEverton and 92 England caps, has
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to the charge and will
OL,9,Fnext appear at Chester Magistrates'
OL,10,FCourt on 7 December.
